URL: https://github.com/geomarker-io/appc, https://geomarker.io/appc/
Description: Collects and harmonizes ambient air pollution measurements and
    develops models for daily concentrations at exact locations across the
    contiguous US. Predictor assessment is provided by the 'geomarker' package.
    Model generation 3 covers January 2017 through June 2026.
